5aea761c35c0b850d8.mp4?t=1760191791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environments shift dynamically over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies grow more aggressive, with new gameplay mechanics activating as the pressure builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual and audio cues reflect rising tension and danger</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Hell over Me — a fast-paced first-person roguelike shooter. Explore unpredictable worlds of sci-fi hell, fight modular enemies, and combine procedural weapons with active abilities. Choose modifiers and build your character. Every fight is unique, any mistake fatal.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/ded34cf9644edc5519f911be1eb79ffc655e0353/header.jpg?t=1760191791", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/40732f72cef12aa22ae0df6492b69bcda1897260/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760191791", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/40732f72cef12aa22ae0df6492b69bcda1897260/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760191791", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5—8400F / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA 1660<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2400 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 Monterey<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 / Intel(R) Core(TM) i5—8400F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 GPU / A